# Fixed-point arithmetic: two decimal places, rounded half away from zero (DESIGN.md §4.1).
calc 4.00 * 0.41
assert calc 0.05 * 0.50 == 0.03
assert calc -0.05 * 0.50 == -0.03
assert calc 1.00 / 3.00 == 0.33
assert calc 2.00 / 3.00 == 0.67
assert calc -2.00 / 3.00 == -0.67
assert calc 12.5 + 0 == 12.50
assert calc 95 + 10 == 105.00

# Mistakes are reported, not rounded away.
assert calc 1 / 0 == error: cannot divide by 0.00
assert calc 12.345 + 1 == error: 12.345 has more than 2 decimal places
